  "path_check_instructions": {
    "1": "Search for Implementation Manager, Solutions Manager, and Deployment Lead roles at early-stage AI healthcare startups (Seed to Series A). Look for companies with recent funding building AI tools for clinicians, care teams, or health systems. Prioritize companies where domain expertise is a competitive advantage. Disqualify companies with no AI product or pure consulting shops. Roles must be available in the United States or Remote.",
    "2": "Search for Solutions Manager, Implementation Lead, and Deployment Manager roles at enterprise healthcare software companies. Look for large vendors whose products serve hospitals, clinics, or payers and that are investing in AI. Disqualify companies where AI is purely marketing with no shipped features. Roles must be available in the United States or Remote.",
    "3": "Search for Solutions Architect, Forward Deployed Engineer, and Applied AI roles (healthcare vertical) at AI platform companies. Look for teams focused on enterprise or healthcare verticals. Disqualify pure research roles with no customer-facing component. Roles must be available in the United States or Remote."
  },
